---
layout: base.njk
---
{#- Service page template (Pest Tech Service Page.dc.html). Each page in src/services/ supplies:
    serviceName, fullTitle, description, bookHeading, quoteFrom, and optionally quoteFull and noReferral.
    Copy above the <!-- details --> marker is the short answer shown before the booking box. Copy below it
    is the longer explanation shown after the booking box (voice guide: lead like a text, teach like a visit). #}
{%- set parts = content.split("<!-- details -->") %}
<p class="crumbs"><a href="/services">Services</a> → {{ serviceName }}</p>
<h1 class="left">{{ serviceName }}</h1>
{{ parts[0] | safe }}
<hr>
<h2>{{ bookHeading }}</h2>
{% include "booking-embed.njk" %}
<p class="note">Prefer a human? Call or text <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.tel }}">{{ site.phone.display }}</a>, or use the <a href="/book#request">plain request form</a>.</p>
{%- if parts[1] %}
<hr>
<div class="details">
{{ parts[1] | safe }}
</div>
{%- endif %}
{%- set r = reviews | reviewBy(quoteFrom) %}
{%- if r %}
<hr>
<h2>Neighbors say</h2>
<blockquote>
  <p>“{{ r.quote if quoteFull else r.excerpt }}”</p>
  <footer>{{ r.name }}, {{ r.neighborhood }}</footer>
</blockquote>
{%- endif %}
{%- if not noReferral %}
<p>We're <a href="/referrals">referral-based</a>. If you send a friend or neighbor our way and they start Regular Service, your next invoice is on us. Just text us.</p>
{%- endif %}
<hr>
<p class="other-services">Other services:
{%- for s in services | except(slug) %} <a href="/{{ s.slug }}">{{ s.short }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} ·{% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>
